OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThursday will be mainly dry
OL,6,Fwith some sunny spells after any
OL,7,Fmorning low cloud and patchy fog
OL,8,Fclears. A mild day for most, though
OL,9,Frather breezy in the west, where a few
OL,10,Fshowers are possible near the coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FDry with variable cloud and
OL,13,Fclear spells. Fog developing across
OL,14,Fcentral and eastern parts of England.
OL,15,FRather windy in the far north and
OL,16,Fwest, with outbreaks of rain possible
OL,17,Flater.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
